  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Ecuador Panama - NRC Strategic Partnership Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyktninghjelpen/NRC in Colombia, Ecuador and Panama provides life-saving humanitarian assistance to people affected by, or at risk of displacement, or with mobility restrictions/confinements across the three countries &#x2013; main activities are in Colombia hence this is coded as Colombia. NRC focuses on protecting life, integrity and dignity through preparation, emergency response and (early) recovery, as well as improving individuals&apos; wellbeing while creating the necessary conditions for resilience and community-led durable solutions. Sectors include Education, Livelihoods and food security (LFS), Shelter and settlements, Water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH). The project design is informed by a gender analysis and all indicators are disaggregated by sex.</narrative>
  </description>
